{"server":"cn","storyId":"act26side_level_act26side_01_beg","groupId":"act26side","stageId":"act26side_01","title":"我有一个荣美家乡","storyCode":"HE-1","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act26side/level_act26side_01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"93e46ede8684370f0cbdb0f74d5bec1fa614294ccc6d8179a67b120d320a0e5e","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"修道院中众人各有盘算，刚到达此地的费德里科一行被这里的居民拦在大门之外。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g9_monasteryroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"那时恰好是秋天，我与几名逃离家乡的伊比利亚人同行，行走在荒无人烟的荒野上。\n就在我们以为我们将会困死在此处时，面前出现了那座修道院。它就好像是某种奇迹，某种不可能存在于现实中的救赎。\n托雷格罗萨主教阁下接纳了那些无处可去的人。他是一位值得尊敬的老人，是最虔诚的信教者。\n在主教阁下的管理下，这座被困于荒野的修道院恍若被从世间割离，成为某种异境。\n在这里，本不可能有交集的人们和谐共处，互相依靠。尽管生活清贫，但人们不分彼此，都在为了生活而努力。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个字迹，果然是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"当我提出自己的请求时，主教阁下沉默许久后对我说，他不愿拒绝任何需要帮助的人，可我提出的地方太过遥远，他无能为力。\n或许是因为本就不怀太多期望，因此，在被拒绝时我也并不失望。拒绝我的无理请求，主教阁下看起来比我更愧疚难堪。\n我为得见这样一处善人的乐园而深感欣慰，可与此同时，我也难以抑制地想到这样的问题：\n这样一处不适应土壤的奇迹，是否真的能长存于这片大地之上？\n......或许我在这里停留得是有些久了。\n我该再度启程，去往拉特兰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“本不可能有交集的人们”“不分彼此”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"确实，在最初看到那样的景象时，我也有些怀疑自己的眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果只是作为我个人来说的话，真希望这样难得的和平能一直一直持续下去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请进。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾缪安小姐，你在忙吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前你提过的那种正在流行的图案，我和其他人尝试着绣了一些在被褥上，你看这样对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我看看......嗯嗯，你们的手艺很好呢，这个就算摆在商店里卖，我也不会感到奇怪的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没你夸的这么厉害......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在天气凉了，蕾缪安小姐这里的被褥可能不大保暖，大家就凑了点布料送过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢关心~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过给我的话，你们那里会不会不够用？还是优先分给大家吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别看我这样，其实我很强壮，不会轻易生病的哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我们没关系的，大伙匀一匀多少还是没问题的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是蕾缪安小姐，看着也不像是很强壮的样子啊，拉特兰也真是的，怎么派蕾缪安小姐出这么远的门？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，这个嘛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个问题，我也很想问一问我的上级呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g7_chapel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么我们不回去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为莱蒙德他们不能和我们一起！这个理由还不足够？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道你要抛下他们？我做不到！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（笨蛋菲娜，难道我看起来是这么冷血的人吗？要把从小一起长大的朋友丢下，这我当然也做不到啊。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（可是继续像现在这样僵持下去也不是办法，最近大家脾气都开始变坏了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（真的就没有什么更好的解决方法了吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了，怎么又唉声叹气？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真稀奇，怎么就你一个人，德尔菲娜竟然没和你在一起？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱蒙德！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这话什么意思，我和菲娜也不是时时刻刻都在一起吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多吧，你们不是关系好得就差睡一张床了吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们有时候是会一起睡......呃，不对，重点不是这个！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你什么时候回来的？我听说你跟着杰拉尔德叔叔出去狩猎了，这次还顺利吗？有没有受伤？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你受伤了一定要说出来，千万别学杰拉尔德叔叔，什么都自己忍着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，你别瞎操心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我瞎操心？上回受伤不说最后伤口发炎的人是谁？私自去矿脉差点回不来的又是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好，算我错了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？“算你错了”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是我错了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"福尔图娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实我来是想问问你，你......还有德尔菲娜，当然，也包括其他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是想问，你们要不要和我们一起......"},{"type":"narration","text":"青年的话语在中途停住了。\n他忽然沉默起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱蒙德？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了，没什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一会我要出去一趟，可能得晚一点回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"福尔图娜，晚餐前你能来楼顶的圣堂一趟吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把德尔菲娜也喊上......我有件事要告诉你们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g4_gatheringplace_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我看看，这是什么情况？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们在修道院旁边还建了一条街？这都建到移动地块边缘去了......修道院里的空间有这么紧张吗？明明看起来大得很欸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的人口有这么多吗？要养活一大群人不容易吧......特别还是在这样的荒野中央。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"进去看看就知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有人来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？啊，从里面走过来，应该是当地的居民吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫曼那家伙，到底去哪了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗨，看不清脸的帅哥，下午好啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！什么人？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"光环......你们是萨科塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管你们是什么人，有什么目的，都不许再靠近了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚见面，别这么剑拔弩张，大家都和气一点，哎，好好说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下午好，这位先生，我们三人来自拉特兰，不是什么可疑人物，请别紧张......如果能把你手上的武器收起来就更好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特兰的人来这种荒郊野岭有何贵干？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我们是受教宗阁下派遣，来这里寻找我们的两位同僚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是在浪费时间，里凯莱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从表现来看，我认为他很清楚我们的身份与来此的动机，并且怀有敌意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你对拉特兰很反感，表现出了明显的排斥以及不满。你的敌意从何而来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不知道你在说什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一直站在通向侧方街道的入口处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在有意挡住我们的视线。你不希望我们关注那里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那里面有什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这家伙——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，也不必这样挑衅对方，费德里科！虽然我清楚你大概没那个意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你没忘记教宗阁下给你的任务吧？低调、低调，可千万别像之前一样乱来啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有挑衅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，你们这些拉特兰人就是这样，突然出现，把一切都搅得一团乱......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从资料上看，这里的状况本就不容乐观。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你再说一遍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想动手吗？来啊，我奉陪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那边还真是剑拔弩张......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感谢费德里科总能吸引所有目光，偷跑比我想的要轻松。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过那个戴兜帽的家伙......唔，确实不太对劲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，之后再算这笔账。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"得先把人找到才行......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，蕾缪安，让我猜猜看，你会在什么地方？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g2_abandonsancturay"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来今天会是客人很多的一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，杰拉尔德先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本以为能在这里见到斯特凡诺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"主教阁下还有不少事务要处理，刚刚才离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想他应该还没走多远，以您的脚力，现在追上去应该还来得及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你今天还没有拉响琴弦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您喜欢我的琴声的话，我可以现在就为您演奏一曲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你给一些......我们的人带来了快乐，对此我很感激。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但并不是所有人都可以从你的音乐中得到安慰的，至少我不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道像你这样的音乐家为何会在这个地方逗留......我只希望你不会为这里带来灾难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您太高看我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"据我所知，灾难总是在最初就被埋藏在土壤里，而后生根发芽，开花结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果这片花圃里真有这么一粒种子，那么它迟早会破土而出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我......充其量只是一个将这一切纳入眼帘的过客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不会有什么不该发芽的种子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不了多久，一切都会回归正轨，不会有意外，更不会有灾难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，请不要做多余的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是您给我的忠告？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我的警告。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是有够不讲情面，不过没有直接动手，应该已经算是很手下留情了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该说不愧是老前辈吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣衫破旧的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"漂亮的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣衫破旧的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......大姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，今天确实是客人很多的一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请进，意料之外的小客人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣衫破旧的男孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣衫破旧的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫作阿尔图罗，可以知道你们的名字吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g4_gatheringplace_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了，别这么说话，费德里科。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的发言并没有问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之你暂时先别说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有这位小兄弟，别冲动，我们真的只是来找下落不明的同事，不管你，嗯，不管你是什么人，我们都没有敌意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，说得好听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你管他这样的叫没有敌意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，我可以发誓。总之......可以先放我们进去吗？如果方便通知一下这边的负责人就最好不过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯普莉雅......咦，斯普莉雅人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她已经进去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？那个女人什么时候——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啧！不能让你们拉特兰的人在这撒野！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们两个，不是要见主教阁下吗，跟我来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......也好，这是同意我们进去的意思，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我警告你们，别想着和那个女人一样乱跑——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好了！快、快来人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克莱芒？怎么了，发生什么事了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱蒙德！太好了，快通知其他人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有敌袭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，是的！不对，莱蒙德，这两位是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别管他们！具体是什么情况？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，对，对......不好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我刚刚修缮窗户时，看到不远处有些动静——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前的那群强盗，他们又来了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
